This game-book has a very simple combat system. There is no strength or stamina, because all your heroes are just kids, and it`s unlikely that they will achieve success by brute force. Instead, the luck is taken into consideration, because it influences invisibly everyone's life.
Before starting your adventure, roll an ordinary die (d6), and write down the result. This is your luck and it won't change in course of the game. If you face some situations which demand you to test your luck, follow the instructions set forth in the text.
Remember that the success of your adventure depends on your actions, but not on dice rolls. As a rule, you will have to test your luck only in case of emergency, when only a miracle can save you. So, make thorough preparations for the adventure.
In addition, write down the names of your companion characters and items you have on your traveller sheet. Do not forget that all characters have their strengths and weaknesses.

Enjoy the game!